---
// A small, non-literal nod to Germany near the wordmark — three dots in the
// flag's colors, not a flag graphic.
---

<span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 align-middle">
  <span class="inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full" style="background-color: #1a1a1a"></span>
  <span class="inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full" style="background-color: #dd0000"></span>
  <span class="inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full" style="background-color: #ffce00"></span>
</span>
